# This repo is scoped to the LLM wiki only. Everything else at this root
# (pre-existing personal/business folders such as backup/, RH e Financeiro/,
# Banco de Horas/, etc.) predates this setup and is intentionally excluded —
# some of it (e.g. backup/CREDENCIAIS) may contain credentials or sensitive
# personal data and must never be committed. See CLAUDE.md > Git scope.
/*

!/raw/
!/wiki/
!/outputs/
!/CEREBRO.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.gitignore

# OS cruft (still ignored even inside tracked folders)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Temp/cache/editor files
*.tmp
*.bak
~$*
.vscode/

# Obsidian vault config (local app/editor state, not wiki content) —
# applies anywhere, including a vault rooted inside wiki/
.obsidian/

# wiki/backup/ is an 18GB+ dump of old software installers, videos, and
# unsorted personal/business files (not wiki content) filed in from the
# pre-existing root backup/ folder. Kept on disk for browsing in Obsidian,
# but excluded from git — individual documents worth keeping should be
# promoted into raw/ one at a time via the normal ingest workflow instead.
/wiki/backup/
